      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Best installation techs in town. From start to finish, excellence. started with 31 lg solar panels, one 8k Fronius inverter and 1one 3k Fronius Inverter. next was to add two Tesla Powerwall 2 batteries. a year later we took down my solar hot water evacuated tube system and added 20 more lg black panels and swapped out 3 k inverter for another 8 k inverter. Not a small job. the guys then changed out wiring from batteries to main box with 25mm cabling, wow that was fun. another year on and we added a 3rd Tesla Powerwall 2. nothing was too hard for these guys. System wasn't cheap but i can stand alone off the grid if I have to. No blackouts here and no bills, just credits. Derek, Aiden, Alex, Rohan, deb are a working machine that know there products and tech. Highly recommend them anytime. if you want a system that really works, call these guys. installation was slightly delayed, but that was only due to bad weather, otherwise on time. I will say there was no left over work or clean up for me to do.",
