      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Superior Solar installed our 10kW solar system in December 2019.Before installation the installer came with me onto the roof and we discussed the best place to install the panels with help of his little gadget which showed summer and winter shades. He also made me aware that in wintertime I will see a substantial reduction more than normal because of the trees.Superior was the third installer quoting and I'm glad I've chosen them. I haven't chosen them because of the best price but for the best professionalism. The installation itself is as we discussed and as I wanted it. No cables can be seen, just the box outside and high quality work! Also the grid connection was organised and went so smooth that the switch over was barely noticeable.A month or two later I had a funny behavior of one of my panels and someone looked into my issue in almost no time. At the end it wasn't a fault and went away but the fact someone looked into this straight away is a reason to give 5 star for service.I would engage Superior again if I had a second home.",
