      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "One company supplied a quote early but failed there as the system they quoted was way too big to fit into the available space. They didn't even bother to call to discuss the quote until a few weeks later.  Another company didn't want to listen to my requirements when they called and designed a system the way they wanted to do it despite my being clear about what we wanted and where.Spot On Solar were the best of the companies you asked to provide a quote but they just couldn't match Superior Solar on price and product.As far as I'm aware, we ended up being the 1st house in Australia with the lastest LG 340W panels. We also went with enphase micro inverters.",
