      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "A professional outfit and very helpful with their information. The only reason I didn't give them the highest rating for customer service was that their administration staff did drop the ball a bit. Apparently they've since employed another admin person so maybe this problem has been overcome. However this does not detract from the provided service and honesty of their service.Being on the NSW Central Coast I used their Gosford branch and I can thoroughly recommend this family owned company to anyone who wants to install solar on their house.One thing I was very impressed with was that they were thoroughly honest about batteries. Given that I'd done my homework on battery pricing and I had one salesperson (from another company) trying to flog a a 1.2kw battery as part of an overall package; and Superior Solar comes along and confirms my suspicions that in a few years batteries would be a much more economical investment. As far as I'm concerned that was the icing on the cake.",
